      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Operative paragraph 6",
      "pageStart": 5,
      "pageEnd": 6,
      "target": "../sections/sec-006-operative-paragraph-6.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "20. \nRECOMMENDS the Director-General to provide support for mobilization of \nadequate resources required for the eradication of dracunculiasis through the last steps of \nthe programme and for its verification and certification activities for a world free of \ndracunculiasis. \n \n21. \nConsidering the decline in resource mobilization for the success of the programme, \nthe Regional Office embarked upon an awareness campaign and advocacy in 11 endemic \ncountries in the Region for them to allocate national budgets for dracunculiasis eradication in \nthe context of the highly-indebted poor countries (H",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes efforts to mobilize resources for the final stages of dracunculiasis eradication and certification, including advocacy in 11 endemic countries to allocate national budgets, with some countries already responding. It also mentions integrating surveillance into community programmes and seeking local partners.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
