      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "WHA57.10: ROAD SAFETY AND HEALTH",
      "pageStart": 6,
      "pageEnd": 6,
      "target": "../sections/sec-007-wha5710-road-safety-and-health.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The Fifty-seventh World Health Assembly, \n \nOperative paragraph 5.1 \n \n23. \nREQUESTS the Director-General: to collaborate with Member States in establishing \nscience-based public health policies and programmes for implementation of measures to \nprevent road traffic injuries and mitigate their consequences. \n \n24. \nThe Regional Office, in collaboration with Member States, supported the launching of \nthe World report on road traffic injury prevention in four countries in the Region. There has \nbeen extensive dissemination of the report, and more events are planned in Member States to \ndebate and",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes regional action on resolution WHA57.10 on road safety and health, including launching WHO's world report on preventing road traffic injuries in four countries and promotion of trauma care guidelines and injury prevention training.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
