      "target": "../sections/sec-008-wha5711-family-and-health-in-the-context-of-the.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "ANNIVERSARY OF THE INTERNATIONAL YEAR OF THE  \nFAMILY \n \nThe Fifty-seventh World Health Assembly, \n \nOperative paragraph 2.1 \n \n26. \nREQUESTS the Director-General: to raise awareness of health issues relevant to \nfamilies, family members, individuals and the community and to support Member States in \nincreasing their efforts to strengthen health policies on these issues; \n \n27. \nThe Regional Office for Africa is promoting the application of a lifecycle approach to \nimprove family health. Support is being provided to countries in an effort to reach the most \nvulnerable members of families and t",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes regional action under resolution WHA57.11 on family and health, including a life-cycle approach to family health, reaching vulnerable family members and the regional Women's Health Strategy. It also mentions work with partners on strategic plans for family and reproductive health.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
