      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "WHA57.12: REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH: DRAFT STRATEGY TO ACCELERATE PROGRESS TOWARDS THE ATTAINMENT OF INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT GOALS AND TARGETS",
      "pageStart": 7,
      "pageEnd": 8,
      "target": "../sections/sec-009-wha5712-reproductive-health-draft-strategy-to-ac.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "ACCELERATE PROGRESS TOWARDS THE ATTAINMENT OF \nINTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT GOALS AND TARGETS \n \nThe Fifty-seventh World Health Assembly, \n \nOperative paragraph 3.2 \n \n32. \nREQUESTS the Director-General: to devote sufficient organizational priority, \ncommitment and resources to supporting effective promotion and implementation of the \nreproductive health strategy and the “necessary actions” that it highlights.  \n \n33. \nRegional strategies on reproductive health, adolescent health and women’s health for \nthe African Region and their respective frameworks for implementation provide guidance and \npo",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes regional action under resolution WHA57.12 on the reproductive health strategy, including regional strategies on reproductive, adolescent and women's health and a framework for repositioning family planning. It also notes support for a reproductive health road map under NEPAD for the African Union summit.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
