      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "WHA57.14: SCALING UP TREATMENT AND CARE WITHIN A COORDINATED AND COMPREHENSIVE RESPONSE TO HIV/AIDS",
      "pageStart": 9,
      "pageEnd": 10,
      "target": "../sections/sec-011-wha5714-scaling-up-treatment-and-care-within-a-c.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "COORDINATED AND COMPREHENSIVE RESPONSE TO \nHIV/AIDS  \n \nThe Fifty-seventh World Health Assembly, \n \nOperative paragraph 3.1 \n \n45. \nREQUESTS the Director-General: to strengthen the key role of WHO in providing \ntechnical leadership, direction and support to health systems response to HIV/AIDS, within \nthe United Nations system-wide response, as co-sponsor of UNAIDS. \n \n46. \nThe WHO Regional Office for Africa will strengthen collaboration with other UN \nagencies and partners at regional and country levels to ensure attainment of a coordinated \nresponse to HIV/AIDS in the context of primary heal",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Opens the section on resolution WHA57.14 on scaling up HIV/AIDS treatment and care, stating that the Regional Office will strengthen collaboration with UN agencies and partners for a coordinated response within primary health care.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
