      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "WHA 57.16: HEALTH PROMOTION AND HEALTHY LIFESTYLES",
      "pageStart": 12,
      "pageEnd": 13,
      "target": "../sections/sec-013-wha-5716-health-promotion-and-healthy-lifestyles.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The Fifty-seventh World Health Assembly, \n \nOperative paragraph 2.1 \n \n67. \nREQUESTS the Director-General: to give health promotion highest priority in order \nto support its development within the Organization as requested in Resolution WHA51.12, \nwith a view to supporting Member States, in consultation with involved stakeholders, more \neffectively to address the major risk factors to health, including harmful use of alcohol and \nother major lifestyle-related factors. \n \n68. \nThe Regional health promotion strategy (RC51/12) approved in 2001 continues to \nprovide the broad basis for development",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes regional action under resolution WHA57.16 on health promotion and healthy lifestyles, based on the 2001 regional health promotion strategy. It mentions programmes addressing risk factors such as harmful alcohol use and an initiative to improve communication between adolescents, parents and communities.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
